cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Multi-Agent LLM Architecture for Financial Question Answering
  with a Local Model
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Filippo Maria
    family-names: Incecchi
    affiliation: Università degli Studi di Brescia
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-__-__"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FilippoMariaIncecchi/financial-multiagent"
abstract: >-
  A LangGraph multi-agent system that answers financial questions from SEC 10-K
  filings, live market data and macroeconomic series using a four-billion-parameter
  open-weight model executed locally, together with the evaluation harness and the
  complete raw results reported in the thesis of the same title.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - multi-agent systems
  - large language models
  - financial question answering
  - RAGAS
  - local inference
